      "name": "Merge and publish a content change",
      "summary": "Merging an approved content change on the owner's explicit confirmation and publishing it: remove the staging preview, rebuild the main site and watch it.",
      "description": "Merging an approved content change on the owner's explicit confirmation and publishing it: remove the staging preview, rebuild the main site and watch it. A change that is not merged keeps its preview.\n\nCalled from content-change-review after the committee approves. Approving is the committee's judgement and merging is a separate, confirmed act (bean en2d), which is why the merge opens this phase rather than closing the review.",
